{"slug":"Index of Essays","title":"Index of Essays","sourceUrl":"https://mathnuscript.com/content/essays/index-of-essays","publishedAt":"2026-08-02T12:27:00.784Z","words":58,"readingTime":1,"html":"\n<p>Essays are evolving products of my writing. They are a flowing stream of ideas that seek to make a point—from <a href=\"#essay/Why%20Software%20is%20Important\" class=\"internal internal-link alias\" data-essay-slug=\"Why Software is Important\">Why Software is Important</a> to <a href=\"#essay/Towards%20Being%20a%20Man\" class=\"internal internal-link alias\" data-essay-slug=\"Towards Being a Man\">Towards Being a Man</a>. Some are also posted on my blog at my official <a href=\"https://mwaweru.com/\" class=\"external external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">site<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"external-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path d=\"M320 0H288V64h32 82.7L201.4 265.4 178.7 288 224 333.3l22.6-22.6L448 109.3V192v32h64V192 32 0H480 320zM32 32H0V64 480v32H32 456h32V480 352 320H424v32 96H64V96h96 32V32H160 32z\"></path></svg></a>. Enjoy ideas that may last for a long, long while (500 years is the goal).</p>\n<p><a href=\"#writing\" class=\"internal internal-link alias\">Browse all essays.</a></p>","toc":[]}